id: aid-robot
name: Aid Robot
order: 4
optionOf: purpose
optionEffect: 2
description: >
  All Allies within a Large Sphere AoE (centered on you) regain 2(bT) Life and Ki Points. Double the amount regained if you possess 2+ stacks of Power.
text: >
  Aid Robot [Triggered/Start of Turn]: All Allies within a Large Sphere AoE (centered on you) regain 2(bT) Life and Ki Points. Double the amount regained if you possess 2+ stacks of Power.

---

# Your turn begins: every Ally within 3 Squares regains it (chat.mjs aidRobot). Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/start-of-turn, effect 2]
aidRobot();
